      "subtitle": "Il-passat (għ) — past tense with the għ letter",
      "intro": "The past tense works the same way as Lesson 11 — the mamma plus a suffix for each person (Jien -t, Int -t, Hu —, Hi -et, Aħna -na, Intom -tu, Huma -u). This lesson focuses on verbs whose root contains għ — either at the start (għamel, għażel) or in the middle (lagħab, xegħel). Study the tables, then try the exercises.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "id": "ghamel",
          "title": "Għamel — to make / do (root għ-m-l)",
          "rows": [
